WEBVTT

00:02:59.967 --> 00:03:02.637
Amal has three sets
of puppeteers to walk her,

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:06.641
and each team is trained
to give her gesture and nuance,

00:03:06.682 --> 00:03:08.809
which is what brings Amal to life.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.146
Together, there's 12 people
in the company,

00:03:12.146 --> 00:03:14.815
12 people that come
from diverse backgrounds.

00:03:14.857 --> 00:03:19.237
Together, they will walk Amal
all the way from Gaziantep to Manchester,

00:03:19.237 --> 00:03:20.738
giving her life.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.823
"The Walk" is a very ambitious project.

00:03:22.865 --> 00:03:24.742
It's a huge logistical feat

00:03:24.742 --> 00:03:27.036
with all the territory
that we need to cover.

00:03:27.036 --> 00:03:28.454
And it wouldn't be possible

00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:31.082
without the network
of partnerships that we have.